// A recipe box two people share:  who's here, and what the other one changed (epic data P13)
family cookbook is a live room at "/api/rooms/recipes"

live box is an app:
	- its "news" is text
	- its "changes" is a number
	- to add one:
		add (a new recipe with title = "New") to the recipes
	- to draw it:
		<ui-text class="me">{the name of the current person}</ui-text>
		for each person in the people here
			<ui-label class="here">{the name of the person}</ui-label>
		<ui-text class="news">{its news}</ui-text>
		<ui-text class="changes">{its changes}</ui-text>
		<ui-button class="again" onClick={refresh the recipes}>Check now</ui-button>
		<ui-button class="add" onClick={add one}>Add one</ui-button>
		for each recipe in every recipe
			draw the recipe

a "recipe" is a view:
	- it is saved in the family cookbook
	- its "title" is text
	- when someone else changes it:
		set the news of the live box to "Someone else changed [its title]"
	- to draw it:
		<ui-form value={it} class="recipe">
			<ui-input name="title" aria-label="Recipe"/>
		</ui-form>

when a recipe changes:
	set the changes of the live box to the changes of the live box + 1

start the live box
